## Authentication

The provider authenticates to the Omada Controller's OpenAPI using a
client ID and secret issued to an Omada Open API application, scoped to a
specific controller (`omadac_id`). Credentials can be supplied either
directly in the provider block or via environment variables:

- `OMADA_HOST`
- `OMADA_CLIENT_ID`
- `OMADA_CLIENT_SECRET`
- `OMADA_OMADAC_ID`

Environment variables are recommended so credentials are not committed to
version control.
